# Compel Brutality, first mode: the creature you control is the source of the damage, so it must still be a legal target as the
# spell resolves (CR 608.2b). Bot2 destroys Hercules in response (Get Lost; Bot1 gets two Map tokens): Hercules can no longer
# deal damage though the other target is still legal, so Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2: Hercules' 3 damage would kill it) survives, and the
# Compel Brutality still goes to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Hercules, Prince of Power
Compel Brutality
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Get Lost
Ornithopter
Island x16

